YieldcoinShareKycExtractor_extract
├── when selector is transfer
│   └── it should return sender and recipient as KYC accounts
├── when selector is transferFrom
│   └── it should return operator, owner, and recipient as KYC accounts
├── when selector is approve
│   └── it should return owner and spender as KYC accounts
├── when selector is increaseAllowance
│   └── it should return owner and spender as KYC accounts
├── when selector is decreaseAllowance
│   └── it should return only the owner as KYC accounts
└── when selector is unsupported
    └── it should revert
